  "decision_conditions": [
    "The outbuilding hereby permitted shall be only used for purposes ancillary and incidental to the main dwelling and for no other purposes. It shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes ancillary to the residential use of the dwelling known as 75 Sandy Lane. It shall at no time be used as a separate residential unit. To ensure the ancillary nature of the outbuilding it shall at no time have;\ri) a separate postal address, \rii) Its own kitchen or cooking facilities when a bathroom or WC is also present.\riii) separate metres for the provision of services,\riv) a separate and registered Land Registry title,\rv) a separate Council tax account,\rvi) a separate access independent of the main dwelling house.\r\rReason:  To ensure the ancillary nature of the outbuilding hereby permitted is not used as a separate unit of residential accommodation or for purposes other than that incidental to the enjoyment of the main dwellinghouse in accordance with policy 9 and 29 of the Sutton Local Plan.",
    "The outbuilding hereby permitted shall be constructed in accordance with the details shown on drawing number P0-2 Rev C and retained thereafter.\r\rReason: To safeguard the visual amenities of the area and to ensure compliance with Policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018."
